{
  "_notes": [
    "Mary Shelley's Frankenstein (Data East, 1995)  IPDB: 947, OPDB: GRB7E-MP3rR",
    "Compiled by Tom Collins <tom@scorbit.io>",
    "2026-02-05: Map based on Guns N' Roses",
    "version 3 game -- clra; ldab <count>; ldx #$1E00; loop adda 0,x / inx / decb; rts -- so the",
    "address the caller stores the result to. Taken from frankst and confirmed against saved NVRAM",
    "hook_501 exactly, which is what validates it.",
    "Other ROM revisions listed under roms were not scanned; they are expected to match frankst, and a",
    "mismatch fails safe because a writer must refuse a region that does not validate.",
    "Adjustments 0x1E00-0x1E5B are protected by a plain 8-bit sum (complement false) at 0x1FDD; see README.md in maps/dataeast."
